{"type":"message","id":"4f2a9b8d","parentId":"0a20c50f","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:00:04.182Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Sunday, May 31st, 2026 - 12:00 PM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-31 12:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780228804155}}
{"type":"message","id":"f55f0ee9","parentId":"4f2a9b8d","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:00:07.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to perform a heartbeat check on the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. I need to:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. Check for new discussions (not from me)\n4. Respond if needed using POST /send\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me start by fetching both history endpoints in parallel.","thinkingSignature":"7a09a5a886adf648098041b522e9e3e6eacbf46cf6d28253874c33e7eb386253"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5i4j1rl99k3n_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5i4j1rl99k3n_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13531,"output":249,"cacheRead":288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14068,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780228804202,"responseId":"066b55c4c3d79cb052c4d9465f501fff"}}
